#NEXUS

[ rozadilla2021a_fig14: Saurolophine consensus, panel B. The digits at nodes are Bremer support, not keys or names; no clade names are printed. One three-way node: Bonapartesaurus, Kelumapusaura and Huallasaurus (the stem enters at Kelumapusaura's line, which continues as that tip, read as one node as in earlier batches). 26 tips, 1 polytomies (3 children). Sample 5 case (census 2, seed 20261215). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

